-- E-CAT-002; base_estimate costs the supersedes decl generically.

-- H7 (compaction rekey): fold only within one aid (D9); coexisting-author and
-- coexisting-generation records BOTH survive derived merges with separate
-- tags; mixed-semiring still E-FMT-002; count overflow still E-TAG-001; base
